These files are modified versions of MediaPipe models by Google LLC, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE):

- face-landmarks-v2.onnx: MediaPipe Face Mesh V2 (face_landmarks_detector.tflite in
  face_landmarker.task, float16/1)
- face-blendshapes-v2.onnx: MediaPipe Blendshape V2 (face_blendshapes.tflite in
  face_landmarker.task, float16/1)
- selfie-segmenter.onnx: MediaPipe Selfie Segmenter, general 256x256 model
  (selfie_segmenter.tflite, float16/1)

Changes made: each TFLite model was converted to ONNX (opset 17) with tf2onnx 1.17.0 by
convert-mediapipe.py; float16 weights were expanded to float32; in the selfie segmenter
MediaPipe's custom Convolution2DTransposeBias operation was replaced by a standard ONNX
ConvTranspose with the same weights and bias; model metadata naming the source and licence
was added. No weights were retrained or altered.

birefnet-lite.onnx (release asset) is a modified version of BiRefNet_lite by ZhengPeng, licensed
under the MIT License (see LICENSE-BiRefNet). Changes made: exported from the PyTorch weights to ONNX
(opset 22) by convert-birefnet.py, with deformable convolutions as native DeformConv nodes and the
decoder's image patches in the channel order the weights were trained with; metadata naming the
source and licence was added. No weights were retrained or altered.
